= Year 1 of the physics and philosophy course of the University of Oxford
{parent=Physics and philosophy course of the University of Oxford}
{title2=Prelims}

Three <physics> papers shared with <physics> Prelims, and two philosophy papers.

= Year 2 of the physics and philosophy course of the University of Oxford
{parent=Physics and philosophy course of the University of Oxford}
{title2=Part A}

Three <physics> papers, laboratory work, and philosophy teaching.

= Year 3 of the physics and philosophy course of the University of Oxford
{parent=Physics and philosophy course of the University of Oxford}
{title2=Part B}

Two <physics> subjects chosen from symmetry and relativity, <general relativity> and <classical mechanics>; philosophy of <quantum mechanics> and further options.

= Year 4 of the physics and philosophy course of the University of Oxford
{parent=Physics and philosophy course of the University of Oxford}
{title2=Part C}

Three units from the <physics> and philosophy lists, with a <physics> project or philosophy thesis among the possibilities.

